  "prompt_mode": "short_sentence_continuation",
  "prompt_text": "Continue the text below with exactly one short, natural, coherent English sentence. Return only the continuation, with no preamble or explanation:\nWhen you die, you appear in a cinema with a number of other people who look like you. You find out that they are your previous reincarnations, and soon you all begin watching your next life on the big screen. You find out that you are all competing to see which of you will get to live the new life. The winner gets to live as a human, while the rest will be reincarnated as animals. This instantly motivates everyone. \n\nThey begin going through different rounds of games as different people are eliminated. I make it pretty far, past a trivia round and a physical endurance challenge. I’m not sure how I did it, but I’m one of the last people left.",
  "reference_single_token_nfa_states": 5,
  "reference_text": "\n\nAs further motivation to win, a screen starts showing the animals some of us will be reincarnated as. They include things like roaches, spiders and slugs. This begins to make people panic and form alliances, hoping any advantage will help them. \n\nThe final round is a game of Russian roulette.",
